\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  A poor and sinful man as I am,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 standing before the Lord today.
\par Be merciful unto me O, Lord
\par follow not my iniquities.
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Look, how numerous sins committed
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 have made my life so miserable
\par Let me have thy glory in thy sight
\par I am your son who has got lost
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  O God of love, O God of mercy
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 listen to my supplication
\par Forgive me all my iniquities
\par and cleanse my heart from all evil
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Don't let me think about anything;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 O, won't you hear my humble cry?
\par Will my plea be of nothing to you?
\par Won't you pay heed to me, my Lord?
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Truly my sins are in abundance
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 that prevents me from being healed.
\par But I will still continue to plead
\par till I become holy and clean
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Help me and cleanse me from all my sins,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 that I receive no punishment;
\par O, Good Father, protect me always
\par and take me again as your son.
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7.   O, Speak, let me have eternal life
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 that I may understand your word
\par My son, I am clearing all your sins
\par go now dear son and sin no more
\par Be, be merciful, be merciful
\par unto me my God of mercies.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  I will not get into argument
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 I know I will be forgiven
\par My happiness in you, in my heart
\par and so will be in me disturbed
\par Be merciful, be merciful
\par \pard     unto me my God of mercies. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

